WEBVTT

1
00:08:41.717 --> 00:08:48.860
Public Program, United Nations Headquarters, New York, USA, 19900606

2
00:08:49.061 --> 00:08:56.773
I bow to you all, for you are the seekers of truth.

3
00:08:57.882 --> 00:09:05.346
When we talk of trutht, we must understand at the very outset

4
00:09:05.546 --> 00:09:12.619
that Truth is what it is. We cannot mould it with our human awareness,

5
00:09:12.819 --> 00:09:18.110
we cannot organize it and we cannot change it at all.

6
00:09:18.310 --> 00:09:22.032
So, what is the truth?

7
00:09:22.232 --> 00:09:27.703
The truth is that we are not this body,

8
00:09:27.903 --> 00:09:34.390
this intellect, emotions, this ego, the conditionings,

9
00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:38.578
but we are the Spirit.

10
00:09:38.778 --> 00:09:46.835
And the second truth is that there is a subtle All-pervading Divine Power

11
00:09:47.035 --> 00:09:50.790
which is doing all the living work.

12
00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:57.666
For example, we see the flowers and we take them for granted.

13
00:09:57.866 --> 00:10:01.377
Mohamed Saab [unsure] has said that, “If you just watch your eyes,

14
00:10:01.577 --> 00:10:06.814
you will be surprised what a camera it is.

15
00:10:07.014 --> 00:10:10.181
So, all living things we take for granted

16
00:10:10.381 --> 00:10:14.894
and we do not inquire as to how these things are worked out

17
00:10:15.094 --> 00:10:20.806
and how all these living processes are going on around.

18
00:10:21.006 --> 00:10:25.025
Now we have, supposing, come from the amoeba stage to this stage.

19
00:10:25.225 --> 00:10:27.954
How have we come?

20
00:10:28.154 --> 00:10:33.436
We did not do anything and how is it we have become human beings

21
00:10:33.636 --> 00:10:37.920
and why have we become human beings?

22
00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:45.021
When I first saw the mandate of the United Nations,

23
00:10:45.221 --> 00:10:51.692
when my husband was elected, I was very happy because what it was saying

24
00:10:51.892 --> 00:10:55.124
was exactly what we have to do,

25
00:10:55.324 --> 00:11:02.545
is to become collective in a way, to have collective benevolence.

26
00:11:02.745 --> 00:11:08.912
But outwardly and superficially, we cannot become collective.

27
00:11:09.112 --> 00:11:12.255
We have to become inwardly collective

28
00:11:12.455 --> 00:11:17.201
and for that something has to happen to us.

29
00:11:17.401 --> 00:11:25.153
Because if we were so easily collective, we would have absolute knowledge

30
00:11:25.353 --> 00:11:29.395
and there would not be any difference of opinion.

31
00:11:29.595 --> 00:11:33.402
Everybody would say the same thing because if it is Absolute truth,

32
00:11:33.602 --> 00:11:36.722
it has to be absolute for everyone.

33
00:11:36.922 --> 00:11:40.730
On the contrary, everybody is saying they have the truth.

34
00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:45.768
It seems they are all absolutely juxtaposition with each other.

35
00:11:45.968 --> 00:11:50.674
So, what is the thing that we are missing?

36
00:11:50.874 --> 00:11:57.229
Whether it is religion, philosophy, thinking or all the philosophies of the world,

37
00:11:57.429 --> 00:12:04.822
I feel that in the United Nations one has to get self-realization.

38
00:12:05.022 --> 00:12:07.794
Unless and until you get Self-realization,

39
00:12:07.994 --> 00:12:14.798
this collectivity, which is the nature of your Spirit, will not manifest.

40
00:12:14.998 --> 00:12:19.065
The Spirit is the collective being within us.

41
00:12:19.265 --> 00:12:23.135
When it manifests, you’ll be amazed at yourself

42
00:12:23.335 --> 00:12:28.108
that you can feel, the centers,

43
00:12:28.309 --> 00:12:31.589
the subtle centres of another person on your fingertips

44
00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:34.243
and you can feel the subtle centres

45
00:12:34.444 --> 00:12:37.137
of your being also on your fingertips.

46
00:12:37.338 --> 00:12:43.817
In Koran, it is very nicely described that at the time of resurrection, your hands will speak.

47
00:12:44.017 --> 00:12:47.005
So when you get your Realization,

48
00:12:47.205 --> 00:12:51.491
you can feel on your fingertips all the subtle centres

49
00:12:51.691 --> 00:12:56.666
about which he was talking to you about. It is to be understood later on.

50
00:12:56.867 --> 00:13:02.007
But the first thing is that you must ask for your enlightenment.

51
00:13:02.207 --> 00:13:07.004
It’s a myth when we say that you are enlightened,

52
00:13:07.204 --> 00:13:10.879
you are born again, or we are this or we are that.

53
00:13:11.079 --> 00:13:14.965
Unless and until you become Spirit in the real sense of the word,

54
00:13:15.165 --> 00:13:18.215
that it is an actualization of the experience,

55
00:13:18.415 --> 00:13:22.581
we are not to believe into it because that kind of belief is just blind

56
00:13:22.781 --> 00:13:29.601
and it’s not for our benevolence or for the benevolence of the whole world.

57
00:13:30.234 --> 00:13:34.057
So this breakthrough in the evolutionary process has to take place.

58
00:13:34.257 --> 00:13:37.932
But for that one has to remember that as we have not prayed

59
00:13:38.132 --> 00:13:41.604
for our evolution so far, we cannot pay for it.

60
00:13:41.804 --> 00:13:45.801
First of all, all people who talk of payment,

61
00:13:46.001 --> 00:13:49.832
you must know that there is something falsehood behind it,

62
00:13:50.032 --> 00:13:52.680
because you cannot pay for it. Like

63
00:13:52.881 --> 00:13:59.230
if you have to sow a seed, you don’t pay anything to the Mother Earth.

64
00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:03.573
You may pay for the hall, you may pay for the car,

65
00:14:03.773 --> 00:14:06.541
but you can’t pay for your self-realization.

66
00:14:06.741 --> 00:14:10.103
This is the first thing to be understood very clearly.

67
00:14:10.303 --> 00:14:12.619
But I find in the Western countries,

68
00:14:12.819 --> 00:14:15.740
it is difficult for people to understand this point.

69
00:14:15.941 --> 00:14:21.947
I was surprised that the BBC people, such a well-equipped and sensible,

70
00:14:22.147 --> 00:14:25.265
they told Me very frankly that the Anglo-Saxon brain

71
00:14:25.465 --> 00:14:29.111
cannot understand anything without money.

72
00:14:29.311 --> 00:14:34.300
I said, “Who has made this Anglo-Saxon brain, first of all?”

73
00:14:34.501 --> 00:14:38.881
The second point is that you believe in Christ.

74
00:14:39.081 --> 00:14:45.014
How much money did you pay to Christ? How much money did you pay to Buddha?

75
00:14:45.214 --> 00:14:50.037
How much money did you pay to Mahavira? Or to Nanaka?

76
00:14:50.238 --> 00:14:54.460
Or to anyone like that? They worked so hard for you.

77
00:14:54.660 --> 00:15:01.162
What did you do for them? Nothing but to torture. And never listened to them.

78
00:15:01.362 --> 00:15:05.606
The truth is so important today for us

79
00:15:05.806 --> 00:15:13.942
that all our problems are there only because we have not felt the truth.

80
00:15:14.142 --> 00:15:16.668
You are talking now about imbalances,

81
00:15:16.868 --> 00:15:21.588
you are talking about the physical problems of drugs and also of AIDS

82
00:15:21.789 --> 00:15:25.457
and all other such things. All these can be cured

83
00:15:25.657 --> 00:15:30.426
and completely prevented if you become the Spirit, you will be amazed.

84
00:15:30.627 --> 00:15:32.774
Because when this Kundalini rises,

85
00:15:32.974 --> 00:15:38.904
She touches that All-pervading Vital Power and you are blessed

86
00:15:39.105 --> 00:15:43.484
with all your physical, mental, and emotional upliftment,

87
00:15:43.684 --> 00:15:48.067
not only that but complete nourishment.

88
00:15:48.267 --> 00:15:56.805
Because this little point was left out, we are suffering.

89
00:15:57.657 --> 00:16:00.985
Ecological problems can be solved very easily

90
00:16:01.186 --> 00:16:03.348
if you get into your balances.

91
00:16:03.549 --> 00:16:09.348
For example, we use machines. For anything, we go to extremes.

92
00:16:09.548 --> 00:16:15.114
We have no balance. Actually, the mental projection is a linear movement.

93
00:16:15.314 --> 00:16:20.739
But if it has no support with reality, it recoils back on you.

94
00:16:20.939 --> 00:16:24.176
Even science, science, of course we must say that

95
00:16:24.376 --> 00:16:26.880
science has done a lot of harm in a way

96
00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:30.290
because it has produced atomic bombs and all that.

97
00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:34.352
But the science also tells us, “This is wrong.

98
00:16:34.552 --> 00:16:37.078
We are going too far with it. We should stop”.

99
00:16:37.278 --> 00:16:42.272
But we don’t pay any heed to it. This is our own mistake

100
00:16:42.473 --> 00:16:47.573
that we have to understand that there is a kind of balance

101
00:16:47.773 --> 00:16:50.999
which is needed in our own lives, in our own temperament,

102
00:16:51.199 --> 00:16:55.123
in our own being. But supposing if you force yourself, you cannot do it.

103
00:16:55.323 --> 00:16:57.873
If you tell yourself, “No, no, no, you must be balanced,

104
00:16:58.073 --> 00:17:03.326
you should have balance, you should have a balanced life”, you cannot.

105
00:17:03.526 --> 00:17:08.670
Because at the human awareness, you cannot.

106
00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:13.596
But once you become the Spirit, it automatically works out.

107
00:17:13.796 --> 00:17:20.049
Now in this diagram, you’ll see there are three channels which are shown

108
00:17:20.249 --> 00:17:28.165
and also there are centres which are shown here which are seven in number.

109
00:17:29.432 --> 00:17:35.224
Now the centres are something like this, I would say,

110
00:17:35.424 --> 00:17:39.422
and this is the left and right side of the two sympathetic nervous systems

111
00:17:39.623 --> 00:17:42.170
and in the centre is the parasympathetic nervous system.

112
00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:47.245
Doctors call it an autonomous nervous system. But who is the "Auto"?

113
00:17:47.445 --> 00:17:53.338
And who controls the "Auto"? And how to reach the "Auto" is the problem.

114
00:17:53.538 --> 00:17:57.533
Supposing you have a tree, very much grown.

115
00:17:57.733 --> 00:18:01.049
You must know it has to have roots down there.

116
00:18:01.249 --> 00:18:06.511
If it has not got those roots developed, it’s about to fall off.

117
00:18:06.711 --> 00:18:10.823
So this is the knowledge of the roots and as scientists,

118
00:18:11.024 --> 00:18:15.194
you must have an open mind about it, absolutely an open mind.

119
00:18:15.395 --> 00:18:18.706
Take it as a hypothesis and if it works,

120
00:18:18.906 --> 00:18:21.012
as honest people, you have to accept it.

121
00:18:21.212 --> 00:18:24.949
For example, my husband always said, “You are a saint, I know.

122
00:18:25.149 --> 00:18:27.559
You are an awliya”. He used to say that.

123
00:18:27.759 --> 00:18:30.131
“But I can’t believe you can make anybody like you.

124
00:18:30.331 --> 00:18:32.951
It’s a different thing, a different category”.

125
00:18:33.151 --> 00:18:35.631
But these days these categories are born.

126
00:18:35.831 --> 00:18:40.732
So many are seeking the truth. Never in the history of spirituality,

127
00:18:40.932 --> 00:18:43.732
you had so many people who are seeking the Truth.

128
00:18:43.932 --> 00:18:48.747
They are misled, I know, and they are used and exploited, I agree,

129
00:18:48.947 --> 00:18:52.598
but they are seekers. So, I call it the blossom time.

130
00:18:52.798 --> 00:18:55.699
This is a special time when this has to happen.

131
00:18:55.899 --> 00:18:58.894
But people have to have a seriousness about it.

132
00:18:59.094 --> 00:19:01.410
When in the society that I move – as you know,

133
00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:07.018
there’s another society also that I have - in which I find people talking like this,

134
00:19:07.218 --> 00:19:12.276
“This guru is very good, he’s expensive, but very good”.

135
00:19:12.476 --> 00:19:17.689
And the one gave some bargains and another has lowered some price.

136
00:19:17.889 --> 00:19:21.385
If you are going to judge your guru by how much money he takes

137
00:19:21.585 --> 00:19:26.220
or how much you can save, then it’s such money-oriented nonsense,

138
00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:32.651
it cannot be anything divine. Divine doesn’t understand money, never.

139
00:19:32.851 --> 00:19:35.385
So, once you understand this simple point,

140
00:19:35.585 --> 00:19:37.589
you’ll be able to reach the truth very easily

141
00:19:37.789 --> 00:19:41.280
that if you have to seek the truth, it’s a living process within you

142
00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:43.768
which has to work it out.

143
00:19:43.968 --> 00:19:49.147
And when it works out, then only you can feel that

144
00:19:49.348 --> 00:19:53.775
beautiful, surrounding All-pervading Power,

145
00:19:53.975 --> 00:19:58.360
about which all the religions have described.

146
00:19:58.560 --> 00:20:01.300
Now, if you go even to the religions which have only talked

147
00:20:01.501 --> 00:20:04.493
of the formless God, or some who have talked of the Form,

148
00:20:04.693 --> 00:20:08.360
there is one common point, they have said: seek the eternal -

149
00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:15.266
all of them has said - seek the eternal and use the temporary

150
00:20:15.466 --> 00:20:19.956
with all understanding in its own limitations.

151
00:20:20.156 --> 00:20:23.121
But you can’t do it, that’s the trouble.

152
00:20:23.321 --> 00:20:27.090
We just can’t keep ourselves into those limitations.

153
00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:29.762
If we take to drinking, we become drunkards.

154
00:20:29.962 --> 00:20:32.862
If we take to work, we become work alcoholics. workaholic

155
00:20:33.063 --> 00:20:37.510
If we take to anything, we go to extremes.

156
00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:42.358
Only thing that really gives us the complete balance is the Spirit.

157
00:20:42.559 --> 00:20:46.400
Now, how? Because Spirit is like the light.

158
00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:51.055
Supposing you are holding a snake in your hand and if somebody tells you

159
00:20:51.256 --> 00:20:56.087
"You are holding a snake in your hand", and it’s all darkness.

160
00:20:56.287 --> 00:21:00.900
Then one may say, “No, it’s not. It’s a rope.” How can you argue?

161
00:21:01.100 --> 00:21:05.634
Till the snake bites the person, he is not going to leave the snake.

162
00:21:05.834 --> 00:21:12.141
The best thing is to put on the light. In that light, he can see and can throw away the snake.

163
00:21:12.341 --> 00:21:15.139
This is how today’s Sahaja Yoga is working.

164
00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:17.383
"Sahaja" means "born with you",

165
00:21:17.583 --> 00:21:22.672
is the right to be united with this Divine Power.

166
00:21:22.872 --> 00:21:25.294
Yoga doesn’t mean standing on your heads.

167
00:21:25.495 --> 00:21:28.602
It doesn’t mean breaking your knees. It doesn’t mean that at all.

168
00:21:28.802 --> 00:21:32.227
If you see Patanjali Yoga, then in the Patanjali,

169
00:21:32.427 --> 00:21:38.265
he has written eight into eight ashtangas into eight folds,

170
00:21:38.465 --> 00:21:42.008
out of which Yama Niyama is a wee bit,

171
00:21:42.208 --> 00:21:49.726
out of which the exercises are even much, much a smaller percentage.

172
00:21:49.926 --> 00:21:55.171
Also, it is said very clearly that when your Kundalini rises,

173
00:21:55.371 --> 00:22:01.719
then you must do this centre or this center is being augmented,

174
00:22:01.919 --> 00:22:08.445
constricted, then you have to use a particular type of an exercise.

175
00:22:08.645 --> 00:22:12.179
Patanjali Yoga is such a big book.

176
00:22:12.379 --> 00:22:16.226
But those people who just make it a physical one

177
00:22:16.426 --> 00:22:19.806
do not understand that we are not only physical being.

178
00:22:20.006 --> 00:22:23.564
If we were only physical being, I get many wrestlers coming to me

179
00:22:23.764 --> 00:22:29.485
to say that, “Mother, we have no peace. Will you give us peace?”

180
00:22:29.685 --> 00:22:34.023
We are much more than physical beings. We are physical beings,

181
00:22:34.223 --> 00:22:37.328
we are mental beings,

182
00:22:37.528 --> 00:22:42.062
we are emotional beings. Above all, we are spiritual beings.

183
00:22:42.262 --> 00:22:45.905
And that spiritual being has to manifest.

184
00:22:46.105 --> 00:22:50.124
That manifestation has to take place in our awareness.

185
00:22:50.324 --> 00:22:53.241
Then so many things happen to us.

186
00:22:53.441 --> 00:22:56.288
First of all, as I told you, that with this connection,

187
00:22:56.488 --> 00:22:59.109
this vital energy starts flowing through you.

188
00:22:59.309 --> 00:23:06.778
Now this energy has got so many qualities. First is it comforts you.

189
00:23:06.979 --> 00:23:11.396
It comforts you, in the sense, it cures you, automatically.

190
00:23:11.596 --> 00:23:15.496
It’s your own power that cures you. Of course, it is true.

191
00:23:15.697 --> 00:23:18.585
Through Sahaja Yoga, people have been cured of blood cancer,

192
00:23:18.786 --> 00:23:22.468
of many serious diseases and, if you would allow me,

193
00:23:22.668 --> 00:23:26.913
I would say that AIDS has also been cured with Sahaja Yoga

194
00:23:27.113 --> 00:23:29.187
in Australia, no doubt.

195
00:23:29.387 --> 00:23:33.603
But such complications that, in this country, you cannot cure anyone.

196
00:23:33.804 --> 00:23:36.115
I mean, I don’t cure but even if your Kundalini cures,

197
00:23:36.315 --> 00:23:39.701
you may be arrested for that.

198
00:23:39.901 --> 00:23:42.529
I mean, in all the Western countries this is a problem

199
00:23:42.729 --> 00:23:46.113
and in India, an AIDS patient cannot come.

200
00:23:46.313 --> 00:23:52.464
All such complications are there. But these things are so easily cured,

201
00:23:52.664 --> 00:23:57.222
if you allow your Kundalini to rise and now doctors have accepted it.

202
00:23:57.422 --> 00:23:59.620
I must say that Russians,

203
00:23:59.820 --> 00:24:02.114
whatever you may say about their radiums and all that.

204
00:24:02.314 --> 00:24:05.153
Forget about it. I’m not interested in their politics.

205
00:24:05.353 --> 00:24:10.806
But the people are so wise, so wise and so sensible.

206
00:24:11.007 --> 00:24:15.981
Their doctors and Nobel Prize winners are so sensible, so serious-minded.

207
00:24:16.181 --> 00:24:18.409
They have taken to Sahaja Yoga so seriously.

208
00:24:18.609 --> 00:24:21.855
I’m amazed that what’s the use of our democracy

209
00:24:22.055 --> 00:24:24.987
that he had all over that we did not understand

210
00:24:25.187 --> 00:24:29.395
the importance of our ascent that we have to find something.

211
00:24:29.595 --> 00:24:32.559
We are so satisfied with ourselves, whatever we have?

212
00:24:32.759 --> 00:24:36.113
We talk of ecological problems, this problem, that problem,

213
00:24:36.313 --> 00:24:40.035
but we don’t think how we can get out of it.

214
00:24:40.235 --> 00:24:43.050
We never bothered to see what will help us.

215
00:24:43.250 --> 00:24:45.785
People talk of spirituality here and there.

216
00:24:45.985 --> 00:24:48.761
It’s a serious thing one has to understand.

217
00:24:48.961 --> 00:24:55.026
If the United Nations has to express itself in reality,

218
00:24:55.226 --> 00:24:57.800
then I would say the people of United Nations

219
00:24:58.000 --> 00:25:00.338
must get their Self-realization first.

220
00:25:00.538 --> 00:25:04.815
And then they can understand what they are, how great they are,

221
00:25:05.015 --> 00:25:08.049
how glorious they are.

222
00:25:08.250 --> 00:25:12.424
So many ways and so many powers they have which they can use

223
00:25:12.625 --> 00:25:15.767
and this is the Power of Love which we have never used.

224
00:25:15.968 --> 00:25:20.107
When you read about the United Nations, you think it was conceived

225
00:25:20.307 --> 00:25:24.002
as a thing which works on the Power of Love.

226
00:25:24.203 --> 00:25:29.753
But where is that Power of Love? That is this All-Pervading Power.

227
00:25:29.953 --> 00:25:33.691
You become extremely dynamic,

228
00:25:33.891 --> 00:25:39.721
extremely active, extremely sensible, wise,

229
00:25:39.921 --> 00:25:44.714
but above all, extremely compassionate.

230
00:25:44.914 --> 00:25:48.752
And this is what has to happen to us. It is not lip service.

231
00:25:48.953 --> 00:25:51.659
We cannot sit on the table and talk of peace.

232
00:25:51.859 --> 00:25:55.873
I’ve known people who’ve got Nobel Prize in peace.

233
00:25:56.073 --> 00:25:58.844
They are the hottest people you could ever think of, I tell you.

234
00:25:59.044 --> 00:26:02.227
I don’t know how they got this prize, maybe for some sort of a

235
00:26:02.427 --> 00:26:06.104
thing they did on a very superficial level.

236
00:26:06.304 --> 00:26:12.674
But the person who is not peaceful within himself, how can he spread peace?

237
00:26:12.874 --> 00:26:15.869
You have to have your own peace within yourself,

238
00:26:16.069 --> 00:26:18.338
you have to feel your peace within yourself,

239
00:26:18.538 --> 00:26:21.362
and then only you can do something about it.

240
00:26:21.562 --> 00:26:25.605
A person who has achieved that, even the presence of such a person

241
00:26:25.805 --> 00:26:30.355
can emit that peace that we are talking about.

242
00:26:30.555 --> 00:26:35.551
So I have to request you all as members of the United Nations,

243
00:26:35.751 --> 00:26:39.365
because my husband has been there for 16 years, as you know.

244
00:26:39.565 --> 00:26:44.510
and he had to resign otherwise they would not allow him to get out.

245
00:26:44.710 --> 00:26:46.751
I told him that unless and until you resign,

246
00:26:46.952 --> 00:26:48.952
I would not be able to talk like this to them.

247
00:26:49.153 --> 00:26:53.535
But it’s a fact, I must tell you, as members of United Nations,

248
00:26:53.735 --> 00:26:56.662
all of you have to ask for your Self-realization,

249
00:26:56.862 --> 00:26:59.072
to understand yourself fully well

250
00:26:59.273 --> 00:27:02.018
and then you will see how dynamic you become.

251
00:27:02.218 --> 00:27:04.682
All of your problems become immediately solved,

252
00:27:04.882 --> 00:27:07.213
because you become detached from your problems

253
00:27:07.413 --> 00:27:10.514
and you can see them better and you can solve them better. This knowledge is such a lot that I cannot cover the whole subject in one lecture. I must have given thousands of lectures only in the English language.

254
00:27:10.715 --> 00:27:15.017
I mean, this knowledge is such a lot that I cannot cover

255
00:27:15.217 --> 00:27:17.669
the whole subject in one lecture. I must have given

256
00:27:17.870 --> 00:27:21.205
thousands of lectures only in the English language.

257
00:27:21.405 --> 00:27:25.071
But I would say that like these lights are here

258
00:27:25.271 --> 00:27:27.696
and if I have to tell you about electricity, how it has come,

259
00:27:27.896 --> 00:27:30.470
how it was discovered and all that, it’s a headache.

260
00:27:30.670 --> 00:27:32.813
It’s better I tell you that you put on the light.

261
00:27:33.013 --> 00:27:37.969
It’s better that we have our light and see for ourselves in our light

262
00:27:38.169 --> 00:27:40.760
what our problem is. People get mad,

263
00:27:40.960 --> 00:27:43.275
they don’t know they are getting mad, people get cancer,

264
00:27:43.475 --> 00:27:46.104
they don’t know they are getting cancer, they are all the time

265
00:27:46.304 --> 00:27:50.018
under the fear, "this might happen to me, that might happen to me."

266
00:27:50.218 --> 00:27:53.296
But with Sahaja Yoga, immediately you will know what’s wrong with you

267
00:27:53.496 --> 00:27:57.676
and if you will know how to correct it, it hardly takes any time.

268
00:27:57.876 --> 00:28:02.214
But the transition between the awakening of the Kundalini and the mastering,

269
00:28:02.415 --> 00:28:05.526
it is hardly one month’s time. But even that much patience,

270
00:28:05.727 --> 00:28:09.466
people don’t have, how are you going to work out?

271
00:28:09.666 --> 00:28:14.746
But it’s very amazing, just think of it, is very amazing

272
00:28:14.947 --> 00:28:20.428
that the eastern block people are so easily taking to it

273
00:28:20.628 --> 00:28:23.442
that russians are so easily taken to it,

274
00:28:23.644 --> 00:28:28.470
while we, who have the freedom to express ourselves,

275
00:28:28.670 --> 00:28:33.212
freedom to do what we like are not so good.

276
00:28:33.412 --> 00:28:40.151
I must confess that I really was astounded

277
00:28:40.351 --> 00:28:44.135
the way these people reacted. What’s wrong with us?

278
00:28:44.335 --> 00:28:47.064
Why shouldn’t it happen to us here?

279
00:28:47.264 --> 00:28:51.392
I just cannot put my finger on to anything as such,

280
00:28:51.592 --> 00:28:55.816
while all kinds of falsehood we accept, all kinds of falsehood.

281
00:28:56.016 --> 00:28:58.160
I mean, if somebody comes and says, “All right, you dance.”

282
00:28:58.360 --> 00:29:02.857
So we think we are spiritual, anything.

283
00:29:03.058 --> 00:29:07.347
But nobody has been able to deliver the goods.

284
00:29:07.547 --> 00:29:11.711
I always say, “If you have a guru, what have you got from your guru?”

285
00:29:11.912 --> 00:29:15.667
I am your Mother, say. I would like to know: what powers have you got?

286
00:29:15.867 --> 00:29:18.324
Now this gentleman who spoke to you today,

287
00:29:18.524 --> 00:29:23.247
do you know how many people he has given realization to?

288
00:29:23.447 --> 00:29:27.873
How many things he has done? There are many sitting here who have been doing all these things.

289
00:29:28.074 --> 00:29:30.646
They look just like you, simple people,

290
00:29:30.847 --> 00:29:36.004
leading a very simple life, a very sane life, good people.

291
00:29:36.204 --> 00:29:39.433
As my husband would say, “They are all angels.”

292
00:29:39.633 --> 00:29:43.381
But they have become angels. Some of them were drug addicts,

293
00:29:43.581 --> 00:29:49.311
some of them were very immoral, some of them were absolutely lost cases

294
00:29:49.511 --> 00:29:53.716
and see where they are. And why can’t we learn this art?

295
00:29:53.916 --> 00:29:58.732
It is simple, so easy. You don’t have to pay. It’s your own.

296
00:29:58.932 --> 00:30:01.942
This is what sometimes I can’t understand

297
00:30:02.142 --> 00:30:05.458
and I would be very happy if you can ask me some questions about it.

298
00:30:05.658 --> 00:30:12.131
But I really request you people, to take it up seriously and work it out.

299
00:30:12.331 --> 00:30:15.428
When people will see how you’ve changed, how you have transformed,

300
00:30:15.628 --> 00:30:20.560
how you have become dynamic, they will definitely follow you.

301
00:30:20.760 --> 00:30:23.240
You cannot force it on you. That’s the only problem

302
00:30:23.440 --> 00:30:27.716
is that your freedom is to be respected.

303
00:30:27.916 --> 00:30:31.614
You cannot say that you have to take your Realization.

304
00:30:31.814 --> 00:30:35.887
You have to understand yourself mentally and to ask for it.

305
00:30:36.087 --> 00:30:38.286
Otherwise, it cannot be forced.

306
00:30:38.486 --> 00:30:41.934
But I would like to have some questions from you.

307
00:30:42.134 --> 00:30:46.577
Thank you, thank you very much.

308
00:31:25.302 --> 00:31:30.456
[Question about Transcendental Meditation]

309
00:31:32.091 --> 00:31:36.812
It’s a very controversial subject, but if you want me to tell you the truth,

310
00:31:37.013 --> 00:31:41.807
I can tell you the truth without any fear.

311
00:31:42.932 --> 00:31:49.982
I came to know about Transcendental Meditation when I was in London.

312
00:31:50.182 --> 00:31:55.497
A gentleman contacted me saying that he would like to see me.

313
00:31:55.697 --> 00:31:59.395
So I said, “Why?” He said, "I am suffering from epilepsy,

314
00:31:59.595 --> 00:32:05.131
my wife is suffering from epilepsy, my daughter is suffering from epilepsy.

315
00:32:05.331 --> 00:32:09.092
I said, “All right, come and I have you, I would like to see you, come.”

316
00:32:09.292 --> 00:32:11.818
So I gave him a time and he came down.

317
00:32:12.018 --> 00:32:18.653
I was amazed when he told me that he was the head

318
00:32:18.854 --> 00:32:23.997
of the Flying Foundation of Transcendental Meditation.

319
00:32:24.197 --> 00:32:27.900
And his deputy director had also come

320
00:32:28.100 --> 00:32:31.400
and when I asked him what is this Transcendental Meditation,

321
00:32:31.600 --> 00:32:36.109
I was amazed that the whole thing…

322
00:32:36.310 --> 00:32:42.491
He told me that "we had to do three mantras".

323
00:32:42.692 --> 00:32:50.074
for which they had to pay 300 pounds each.

324
00:32:50.275 --> 00:32:54.106
I said, “What are those mantras?” First, he was hesitating.

325
00:32:54.306 --> 00:32:56.523
I said, “You have to tell me the mantras otherwise

326
00:32:56.723 --> 00:33:01.306
I will not be able to say what it is, why you have caught epilepsy.”

327
00:33:01.506 --> 00:33:08.862
He said, “The first mantra was inga. The second was pinga and third was thinga.”

328
00:33:09.062 --> 00:33:13.831
If there is any Indian gentleman here he will know what it means.

329
00:33:14.031 --> 00:33:20.018
Inga means the bite of a scorpion, is not a Sanskrit word.

330
00:33:20.218 --> 00:33:23.355
Pinga means when a person gets possessed he goes round and round,

331
00:33:23.555 --> 00:33:29.320
that's pinga, and thinga means when you show like that a thumb.

332
00:33:29.520 --> 00:33:31.890
For that, they paid 300 pounds

333
00:33:32.090 --> 00:33:34.875
and they were told not to talk about it to anyone.

334
00:33:35.075 --> 00:33:42.810
Now, this is coming from the head of that foundation who was suffering from epilepsy.

335
00:33:43.010 --> 00:33:46.788
This poor fellow he became ultimately bankrupt.

336
00:33:46.988 --> 00:33:51.264
His wife was a granddaughter of a duke in England.

337
00:33:51.464 --> 00:33:54.895
Of course, they were all cured, they are alright,

338
00:33:55.096 --> 00:33:57.302
but he had to go away to South Africa.

339
00:33:57.502 --> 00:34:03.580
He was a diamond merchant and he lost everything as a bankrupt.

340
00:34:04.682 --> 00:34:10.544
Then so many came from there and so many who had become just recluses.

341
00:34:10.744 --> 00:34:16.466
They could not see the garlic or they could not see a lemon.

342
00:34:16.666 --> 00:34:19.965
If you showed them the lemon, they used to tremble.

343
00:34:20.165 --> 00:34:22.410
In the beginning, they said they felt very much elated.

344
00:34:22.610 --> 00:34:26.404
Of course, about this, I will tell you later on about how our souls are

345
00:34:26.604 --> 00:34:30.091
and how our souls can be possessed.

346
00:34:30.291 --> 00:34:33.911
You asked me directly so I have to tell you very directly, madame.

347
00:34:34.111 --> 00:34:37.724
The second thing that they did was to start a siddha course,

348
00:34:37.924 --> 00:34:42.327
they called it, for which they charged 6,000 pounds

349
00:34:42.527 --> 00:34:48.803
and people had to go to Switzerland to stay in hotels

350
00:34:49.003 --> 00:34:51.256
and they were given some mats to jump,

351
00:34:51.456 --> 00:34:56.107
because they were supposed to fly in the air, so-called.

352
00:34:56.307 --> 00:35:00.325
First of all, why do you want to fly in the air halfway like that?

353
00:35:00.525 --> 00:35:08.392
Imagine already there are such problems of traffics, because of that, I was delayed.

354
00:35:09.080 --> 00:35:13.153
And so many people paid 6,000 pounds for that.

355
00:35:13.353 --> 00:35:18.434
Now the food that was given – it’s authentic, absolutely –

356
00:35:18.634 --> 00:35:25.642
for six days, was the water that boiled potatoes.

357
00:35:25.843 --> 00:35:28.560
Six says and the seventh day was [UNCLEAR]

358
00:35:28.760 --> 00:35:34.968
and the eighth day they were given the potatoes to eat.

359
00:35:35.695 --> 00:35:39.057
And they were told that "you have to do it if you have to fly in the air."

360
00:35:39.257 --> 00:35:43.131
So many of them broke their bottoms

361
00:35:43.332 --> 00:35:50.808
and broke their bones, pelvic bones, is a fact.

362
00:35:52.985 --> 00:35:55.863
And I think the guru must have felt what stupid people these are,

363
00:35:56.063 --> 00:36:00.355
so he used to giggle all the time, he was called as the giggling guru.

364
00:36:00.555 --> 00:36:07.354
If people are that stupid, what can you do about it?

365
00:36:07.554 --> 00:36:10.175
And they don’t know. I said, “Why don’t you ask them,

366
00:36:10.375 --> 00:36:13.471
‘Why this mantra? Why? What is this? For what?”

367
00:36:13.671 --> 00:36:16.315
In Sahaja Yoga, you know each and everything.

368
00:36:16.515 --> 00:36:20.291
Of course, after Realization, you have to know all about the mechanism,

369
00:36:20.491 --> 00:36:23.487
you have to know about what is the… say, for example,

370
00:36:23.687 --> 00:36:26.565
the Kundalini stops at this centre of the optic chiasma,

371
00:36:26.765 --> 00:36:29.816
then you have to say the Lord’s Prayer.

372
00:36:30.016 --> 00:36:34.424
You have to say, “Allah hu Akbar” at this point. So many there are.

373
00:36:34.625 --> 00:36:41.250
But it’s so scientific that you can see the movement of the Kundalini.

374
00:36:43.164 --> 00:36:46.152
All kinds of stupid things people do.

375
00:36:46.352 --> 00:36:48.874
Somebody says ‘shakti path’, somebody says that.

376
00:36:49.074 --> 00:36:53.654
And pPeople become really mad after that.

377
00:36:53.854 --> 00:36:57.082
First of all, what knowledge did you get? Put that question.

378
00:36:57.282 --> 00:37:02.877
You must go and see the disciples, what knowledge there is?

379
00:37:04.486 --> 00:37:07.005
Nowadays, supposing somebody has started Ayurveda.

380
00:37:07.205 --> 00:37:09.947
We don’t need any guru for that, you can go to Ayurveda

381
00:37:10.148 --> 00:37:14.191
any time. Is like just your medicine,

382
00:37:14.392 --> 00:37:19.488
you don’t need a guru to go to any doctor, do you?

383
00:37:19.688 --> 00:37:24.830
But we are so dumb and here I don’t know how people accept these things,

384
00:37:25.031 --> 00:37:27.261
still, I can’t understand.

385
00:37:27.461 --> 00:37:31.364
There’s a lady who has laser beams, put like that, you see, from outside

386
00:37:31.565 --> 00:37:39.003
and for one meeting like this, she takes 3,000 pounds, 3,000 pounds,

387
00:37:39.203 --> 00:37:42.698
that to enrol. Can you believe it?

388
00:37:42.898 --> 00:37:45.667
Because you’ve asked me the question I have to tell you

389
00:37:45.867 --> 00:37:49.522
this is what is going on, Madam, and for Chinese especially,

390
00:37:49.722 --> 00:37:51.737
you be very careful. You are very vulnerable

391
00:37:51.938 --> 00:37:53.938
because now you have become very rich

392
00:37:54.139 --> 00:37:57.689
and they only cling on to rich people, so be very careful.

393
00:37:57.889 --> 00:38:01.400
First of all, you must find out what are the disciples like,

394
00:38:01.601 --> 00:38:06.593
what are they doing and how they are doing.

395
00:38:06.793 --> 00:38:10.141
I talked about it in 1970.

396
00:38:10.341 --> 00:38:15.227
Openly I told their names and gave their names, what devils they are.

397
00:38:15.427 --> 00:38:20.462
But nobody would listen to me. Even this Rajneesh, I told about him so many things.

398
00:38:20.663 --> 00:38:23.823
And they are the ones stopping us coming to you and everywhere.

399
00:38:24.023 --> 00:38:29.439
Do you know that? They are putting money to many newspapers

400
00:38:29.639 --> 00:38:34.171
that I should not be there in any way.

401
00:38:34.372 --> 00:38:39.385
Even my advertisement should not be there.

402
00:38:39.585 --> 00:38:42.558
But they are all very friendly because Satan

403
00:38:42.758 --> 00:38:47.933
doesn’t speak against his own house. Christ said it clearly.

404
00:38:48.133 --> 00:38:50.331
They are all very friendly with each other.

405
00:38:50.531 --> 00:38:54.029
But we have to know the truth and the truth is that

406
00:38:54.253 --> 00:38:57.869
you have to become the Spirit and you must get the powers of the Spirit.

407
00:38:58.069 --> 00:39:03.246
If you do not have the powers of the Spirit, don’t listen to these big claims.

408
00:39:03.446 --> 00:39:09.394
There is nothing to be claimed about. It is to be achieved, to be actualized.

409
00:39:11.906 --> 00:39:15.159
I’m sorry I have to say all this, but one has to say,

410
00:39:15.359 --> 00:39:19.921
because she asked me a question about it.

411
00:39:20.710 --> 00:39:23.854
Moreover, there is another problem.

412
00:39:24.054 --> 00:39:27.565
The another problem is like this that if you pay money for something,

413
00:39:27.765 --> 00:39:33.092
say, we go to a theatre and we pay money for a ticket

414
00:39:33.292 --> 00:39:37.518
and then what we find that it's not very good, the play is not very good,

415
00:39:37.734 --> 00:39:41.834
but we say "let’s have it, you see, we have paid for it", we go through it.

416
00:39:42.034 --> 00:39:46.575
So this commitment because of payment is even worse.

417
00:39:46.775 --> 00:39:51.060
So you come out from there hurt and see people,

418
00:39:51.260 --> 00:39:57.347
their Kundalini just like, I cannot tell you how it looks,

419
00:39:57.548 --> 00:40:01.132
as if it’s been beaten up

420
00:40:01.332 --> 00:40:07.273
and trying to rise putting up Her head and again it falls down.

421
00:40:07.473 --> 00:40:13.045
So weak she is and she is your Mother, your individual Mother.

422
00:40:13.245 --> 00:40:18.616
And she feels so helpless that she cannot give you your Self-realization,

423
00:40:18.816 --> 00:40:21.804
She cannot give you your second birth,

424
00:40:22.004 --> 00:40:26.171
because you have stupidly followed something which was very wrong.

425
00:40:26.371 --> 00:40:32.976
Even though, I must tell you, that Sahaja Yoga works out even such difficulties.

426
00:40:33.176 --> 00:40:36.241
All kinds of things are going on. Let somebody bring some diamond

427
00:40:36.441 --> 00:40:40.761
or somebody shows some sort of ashes and things.

428
00:40:40.961 --> 00:40:46.576
For a diamond, you can go to a shop here, you see?

429
00:40:46.777 --> 00:40:51.588
What has God to do, God, God to do with diamonds?

430
00:40:51.788 --> 00:40:54.886
You see, or any divinity have to do with diamonds?

431
00:40:55.086 --> 00:40:59.595
What do you care for diamonds?

432
00:40:59.878 --> 00:41:04.927
So this is a big, very big problem today, because we have choices, you see,

433
00:41:05.128 --> 00:41:08.117
we have choices of this and choices of that and choices of this.

434
00:41:08.317 --> 00:41:15.387
But we have lost that discretion to find out what we should have.

435
00:41:16.329 --> 00:41:20.644
And so many people are hurt.

436
00:41:20.844 --> 00:41:23.669
I have been talking about it very openly.

437
00:41:23.869 --> 00:41:30.036
Nobody has ever come forward before me and said this and this about Sahaja Yoga.

438
00:41:30.236 --> 00:41:34.810
I have said all sorts of things about them, nobody has come forward so far.

439
00:41:35.010 --> 00:41:38.113
Nobody has said a word about it,

440
00:41:38.313 --> 00:41:42.316
nor did they go to the courts or anywhere against me.

441
00:41:42.516 --> 00:41:48.245
They could have done it very easily, but they could not.

442
00:41:48.445 --> 00:41:55.009
And because you have asked me today, I’d better warn you. It’s true.

443
00:42:00.589 --> 00:42:04.096
Yes, please.

444
00:42:12.675 --> 00:42:16.217
[What is the role of prayer in Sahaja Yoga.]

445
00:42:16.417 --> 00:42:19.452
Role of what? [Of prayer, praying.] Prayer.

446
00:42:19.652 --> 00:42:23.053
[and is the change permanent?]

447
00:42:23.253 --> 00:42:26.874
See now, if you are not connected with the divine,

448
00:42:27.074 --> 00:42:32.479
your prayers are like telephoning without the connection.

449
00:42:32.679 --> 00:42:37.205
That’s why prayers don’t help. And people do come and say that,

450
00:42:37.405 --> 00:42:41.556
“We’ve been praying to God, we've praying, you see now, what is our condition”.

451
00:42:41.757 --> 00:42:47.179
Which god are you praying to? First of all, you must have your connection.

452
00:42:47.379 --> 00:42:54.608
Then even once you remember the name of God, it works,

453
00:42:54.808 --> 00:42:57.655
even once.

454
00:42:57.855 --> 00:43:01.843
But you have to have the connection.

455
00:43:02.043 --> 00:43:07.950
It has a very great role only if you are connected.

456
00:43:14.100 --> 00:43:19.329
[Is the change permanent?]

457
00:43:19.530 --> 00:43:28.329
It is. Once you have to work it out also, that the Kundalini rises,

458
00:43:28.529 --> 00:43:30.993
pierces through your fontanelle bone area,

459
00:43:31.193 --> 00:43:34.251
gives your actualization of baptism nicely,

460
00:43:34.451 --> 00:43:36.885
you should feel the cool breeze coming out of your head,

461
00:43:37.085 --> 00:43:40.916
and you should feel on your hands from all over this cool breeze,

462
00:43:41.116 --> 00:43:44.877
but you have to establish this connection properly.

463
00:43:45.077 --> 00:43:49.353
Sometimes the Kundalini attends to places where you have sickness,

464
00:43:49.553 --> 00:43:53.103
where you have mental problems. So you must learn.

465
00:43:53.303 --> 00:43:57.743
That’s what I said that one month is needed, at the most, to fix it.

466
00:43:57.943 --> 00:44:02.786
Once you are fixed, you are fixed. It’s permanent.

467
00:44:16.940 --> 00:44:21.904
[Being a Christian, how can we practice Sahaja Yoga without feeling a conflict?]

468
00:44:22.104 --> 00:44:27.123
There is no conflict because this is real Christianity, what Christ has said.

469
00:44:27.323 --> 00:44:31.466
You see, the Christianity that you practice is not Christ Christianity.

470
00:44:31.666 --> 00:44:36.976
It’s the Christianity of Mr Paul and, later on, Mr Augustine

471
00:44:37.177 --> 00:44:41.712
who had nothing to do with Christ.

472
00:44:42.321 --> 00:44:47.094
It’s all money-making propositions.

473
00:44:47.493 --> 00:44:51.707
I know because I was born in a Christian family and I asked my father,

474
00:44:51.907 --> 00:44:55.474
I said, “Who is this Mr Paul in the Bible? I can't understand him.”

475
00:44:55.674 --> 00:45:00.058
He said, “Same here, he’s a stranger.” And if you read Kalil Gibran,

476
00:45:00.259 --> 00:45:04.083
he has given a big chapter on this gentleman, Mr Paul.

477
00:45:04.283 --> 00:45:08.221
There’s no conflict at all.

478
00:45:10.345 --> 00:45:13.611
What’s the use of… The other day you must have seen

479
00:45:13.811 --> 00:45:19.631
these fundamentalist, Christian fundamentalist jeering at Gorbachev,

480
00:45:19.832 --> 00:45:22.736
who is a great man, no doubt about it.

481
00:45:22.936 --> 00:45:25.330
because they think they are very great for have they achieved,

482
00:45:25.530 --> 00:45:27.728
Christians, what have they achieved? Tell me.

483
00:45:27.929 --> 00:45:31.539
You see, in India what I know about Christians is that they take a gun in one hand

484
00:45:31.740 --> 00:45:37.895
and a Bible in the other hand. That’s what they are. Let us face it.

485
00:45:38.095 --> 00:45:43.074
What have they done? What good have they done the so-called Christians?

486
00:45:43.274 --> 00:45:48.165
Where we are sitting today in this America, what have they done?

487
00:45:48.366 --> 00:45:53.868
Where have the people gone who lived here, who owned this country?

488
00:45:54.076 --> 00:45:57.006
Thank God Columbus came to this side. Otherwise, our India,

489
00:45:57.206 --> 00:46:03.542
if he had reached, we would be not there anymore, finished.

490
00:46:07.042 --> 00:46:09.693
Same about Hindus, same about Muslims

491
00:46:09.894 --> 00:46:14.332
and same about all the people. These are all man-made religions.

492
00:46:14.533 --> 00:46:18.253
Religion is within ourselves and when it is awakened,

493
00:46:18.454 --> 00:46:22.231
you will really know how righteous you are.

494
00:46:22.431 --> 00:46:25.129
Anybody, whether you are Christian, Hindu, Muslim, Sikh,

495
00:46:25.329 --> 00:46:29.347
any religion you may follow, you can commit any sin.

496
00:46:29.547 --> 00:46:32.855
There is no bondage, no bondage.

497
00:46:33.055 --> 00:46:35.299
You can tell lies, you can murder anyone.

498
00:46:35.500 --> 00:46:38.439
You don’t stop because you are a Christian, you don’t stop because you are a Hindu,

499
00:46:38.640 --> 00:46:45.744
you don't stop anything. But Christ, Christ was such a subtle person.

500
00:46:45.945 --> 00:46:50.475
What he said: “Thou shalt not have adulterous eyes.”

501
00:46:50.675 --> 00:46:58.698
How many Christians have you met without adulterous eyes?

502
00:47:02.126 --> 00:47:07.106
Subtleties of Christ, you can achieve it.

503
00:47:07.306 --> 00:47:11.496
You can definitely achieve it through your self-realization.

504
00:47:11.697 --> 00:47:15.299
The first thing He said and the last thing He said is

505
00:47:15.500 --> 00:47:21.178
“Know Thy Self.”

506
00:47:31.228 --> 00:47:37.384
You will enjoy your Christianity and Christ after Self-realization.

507
00:47:37.585 --> 00:47:43.261
Now for example, you say that Christ was the Son of God.

508
00:47:43.461 --> 00:47:46.754
But many will say, “How do you prove that?” It’s very simple in Sahaja Yoga.

509
00:47:46.954 --> 00:47:51.234
You put your hands like this. After self-realization you ask a question:

510
00:47:51.434 --> 00:47:57.772
“Mother, was Christ the Son of God?” And see the vibrations, they start coming, cool breeze.

511
00:47:57.973 --> 00:48:02.023
But ask about somebody horrible and you might get a little burning

512
00:48:02.223 --> 00:48:08.049
or you might get sometimes little blisters.

513
00:48:09.338 --> 00:48:13.757
Because you were born in a religion, you follow it.

514
00:48:13.957 --> 00:48:21.191
But then you follow Him, not blindly, but with an awakened mind.

515
00:48:34.348 --> 00:48:38.836
Yogi: I also I want to inform you that generally,

516
00:48:39.036 --> 00:48:45.726
Shri Mataji agrees to grant a session of guided collective meditation

517
00:48:45.926 --> 00:48:51.486
at the end but by most of the people can feel this raising of the Kundalini,

518
00:48:51.686 --> 00:48:59.686
so, by all means, ask questions but of course (...).

519
00:49:04.077 --> 00:49:06.243
So the question now, Shri Mataji, was simply

520
00:49:06.444 --> 00:49:09.508
what is the role of vegetarianism?

521
00:49:09.709 --> 00:49:11.697
It is not so much emphasizing Your teachings,

522
00:49:11.897 --> 00:49:15.080
but it very much is emphasizing in other teachings.

523
00:49:15.280 --> 00:49:19.752
Shri Mataji: You see, this is also an idea which has cropped up some time

524
00:49:19.952 --> 00:49:27.544
within the time of Shri Krishna. His cousin was an eminath who was a Jain gentleman.

525
00:49:27.744 --> 00:49:30.835
And they used to all eat meat and everything,

526
00:49:31.035 --> 00:49:33.538
Krishna, Rama, everybody ate meat.

527
00:49:33.738 --> 00:49:37.141
But what happened that his marriage was to be celebrated.

528
00:49:37.341 --> 00:49:45.178
In the marriage, he saw all these things, so many goats and birds

529
00:49:45.379 --> 00:49:49.938
and all that and he felt a kind of a nausea about it.

530
00:49:50.138 --> 00:49:55.844
So he didn’t marry and also he said "let’s become vegetarians."

531
00:49:56.044 --> 00:49:59.455
That’s how the vegetarianism started in India.

532
00:49:59.655 --> 00:50:03.181
Now that has spread all over now.

533
00:50:03.381 --> 00:50:07.548
And later on the vegetarianism has gone to such a limit among Jains

534
00:50:07.748 --> 00:50:11.743
that you have no idea, that you cannot kill bugs,

535
00:50:11.943 --> 00:50:14.095
you cannot kill (...), you cannot kill anything,

536
00:50:14.295 --> 00:50:19.889
because they are all living things. Apart from that, they get a brahmin,

537
00:50:20.089 --> 00:50:22.303
pay him a lot of money, put him in a hut

538
00:50:22.503 --> 00:50:25.483
and put all the bugs inside the hut

539
00:50:25.683 --> 00:50:31.725
and the bugs have to suck in the blood and when they are all satisfied,

540
00:50:31.926 --> 00:50:36.705
they pay money to the brahmin and go away.

541
00:50:38.281 --> 00:50:41.253
It’s cruelty.

542
00:50:41.453 --> 00:50:44.308
So what is the balancing point is this

543
00:50:44.508 --> 00:50:47.878
that whatever is required for the body should be eaten,

544
00:50:48.078 --> 00:50:51.221
but the animal which is bigger than you should not be eaten,

545
00:50:51.421 --> 00:50:54.428
because that animal’s muscle, as you know, muscle cells are

546
00:50:54.629 --> 00:50:57.338
bigger than your muscle cells and they might harm your teeth,

547
00:50:57.538 --> 00:51:03.793
they might harm your tongue. So if you save the chickens,

548
00:51:03.993 --> 00:51:07.473
am I going to give them realization?

549
00:51:07.673 --> 00:51:10.129
But those who have eaten too much non-veg food

550
00:51:10.329 --> 00:51:12.691
should take to vegetarianism is a good idea,

551
00:51:12.891 --> 00:51:16.649
but not that those who need

552
00:51:16.850 --> 00:51:19.782
non-veg food should not take it.

553
00:51:19.983 --> 00:51:22.268
It’s not what you eat is so important,

554
00:51:22.468 --> 00:51:25.557
is all the funny ideas that have come.

555
00:51:25.757 --> 00:51:31.221
It is what you get as the Spirit. Christ used to eat meat.

556
00:51:31.421 --> 00:51:36.454
Mohammed Saheb used to eat meat, Nanaka used to eat meat, Kabira used to eat meat.

557
00:51:36.655 --> 00:51:39.194
They were all bad people and those who are vegetarians,

558
00:51:39.395 --> 00:51:41.657
so-called, are the very nice people?

559
00:51:41.858 --> 00:51:45.469
In India, I must tell you, those who are strict vegetarians

560
00:51:45.669 --> 00:51:50.692
are one of the worst class, no doubt about it,

561
00:51:50.892 --> 00:51:56.933
because they are extremely cruel, extremely cruel people.

562
00:51:57.134 --> 00:52:00.853
You can ask anyone who are the vegetarians

563
00:52:01.054 --> 00:52:03.474
and you’ll be surprised

564
00:52:03.675 --> 00:52:08.344
they are very money oriented, always run after money

565
00:52:08.560 --> 00:52:15.188
and they are just like, you can call them, [UNCLEAR Shiloh] type.

566
00:52:15.388 --> 00:52:18.753
Very money-oriented people, extremely money-oriented.

567
00:52:18.954 --> 00:52:22.066
But if you don’t like, you don’t eat. There is no force about it.

568
00:52:22.266 --> 00:52:26.758
But somebody who eats because he needs it,

569
00:52:26.959 --> 00:52:32.598
is in no way comes in your spirituality, no way.

570
00:52:32.798 --> 00:52:37.846
I may not eat but I don’t expect you not to eat.

571
00:52:39.416 --> 00:52:42.403
It’s an individual question, it's an individual problem

572
00:52:42.603 --> 00:52:47.931
of a level that it’s not so much concern.

573
00:52:49.353 --> 00:52:52.269
Also, like Rajneesh used to say, or Freud would say that

574
00:52:52.469 --> 00:52:55.633
sex plays a part in your spirituality is absolutely wrong.

575
00:52:55.833 --> 00:53:01.024
It does not, because here you can see the seventh centre,

576
00:53:01.224 --> 00:53:08.892
which we call as the Mooladhara, which is looking after the pelvic plexus,

577
00:53:09.092 --> 00:53:19.275
which is responsible for all the excretion inclusive of sex, is below the Kundalini.

578
00:53:19.475 --> 00:53:28.112
So when the Kundalini rises, all your excretion process stops.

579
00:53:28.312 --> 00:53:33.840
That’s why Christ has said if you have to come to the kingdom of God,

580
00:53:34.040 --> 00:53:37.668
you have to become like small children, innocent.

581
00:53:37.868 --> 00:53:42.474
And you do, because all these things stop

582
00:53:42.674 --> 00:53:47.377
when the ascent of the Kundalini takes place.

583
00:54:34.406 --> 00:54:36.807
Yogi: No. I think there is a little misunderstanding.

584
00:54:37.007 --> 00:54:39.956
Shri Mataji did not say to refrain sexuality.

585
00:54:40.156 --> 00:54:43.108
Shri Mataji said sexuality has nothing to do with Kundalini awakening.

586
00:54:43.309 --> 00:54:46.054
Shri Mataji: Yes. I better correct that. No, no, no, no.

587
00:54:46.254 --> 00:54:48.944
Never I said that, I said that it does not play part

588
00:54:49.144 --> 00:54:56.281
in the ascent of the Kundalini. But sex, in a sane way, is important.

589
00:54:56.482 --> 00:54:59.244
Absolutely important.

590
00:54:59.445 --> 00:55:03.367
If somebody is not married or somebody calls himself a sanyasi,

591
00:55:03.567 --> 00:55:09.826
you tell him better change your ideas. The Kundalini doesn’t rise.

592
00:55:12.073 --> 00:55:16.850
It’s a fact. The Kundalini tells you. She is the best judge.

593
00:55:17.050 --> 00:55:19.883
That’s why while speaking to you I was a little hesitant.

594
00:55:20.083 --> 00:55:24.212
There was one gentleman who hasn’t got realization as yet in London,

595
00:55:24.412 --> 00:55:31.218
only one who is not married, you see. I don’t know what to do with him.

596
00:55:31.418 --> 00:55:36.498
I must confess, it’s true. I mean, what can I do about it.

597
00:55:36.698 --> 00:55:39.904
I don’t mean it. I would love to do that

598
00:55:40.104 --> 00:55:44.021
but somehow he is not getting realization.

599
00:55:44.221 --> 00:55:48.060
I think a sane marriage gives you a balance, a good family

600
00:55:48.260 --> 00:55:56.073
and is your responsibility to produce a good family, to produce good children.

601
00:55:56.737 --> 00:56:00.232
Perhaps that is what is expected.

602
00:56:00.432 --> 00:56:04.583
But I think there’s a misunderstanding because I said only that part.

603
00:56:04.783 --> 00:56:09.736
I mean, at the time of realization.

604
00:56:13.557 --> 00:56:16.466
No, if any such misunderstanding, you must ask me,

605
00:56:16.666 --> 00:56:19.927
because it’s a very short lecture and maybe some points are left out.

606
00:56:20.127 --> 00:56:26.591
It’s better to ask, so there should no misunderstanding about things.

607
00:56:33.015 --> 00:56:35.282
[Christ was not married, she said.]

608
00:56:35.483 --> 00:56:39.915
Yeah, He is different.

609
00:56:40.115 --> 00:56:45.150
You crucified Him so fast. He could only preach for four years.

610
00:56:45.350 --> 00:56:49.320
Christ was different, is very different.

611
00:56:49.521 --> 00:56:54.977
You will understand His nature, what He was

612
00:56:55.183 --> 00:57:01.244
and then you will know why He did not need any marriage.

613
00:57:12.139 --> 00:57:18.261
[She says, Christ said some are born eunuchs for the sake of the kingdom.]

614
00:57:21.950 --> 00:57:28.262
[It's written in the Bible some are born eunuchs for the sake of the kingdom,

615
00:57:28.463 --> 00:57:34.435
meaning some are not taken relationships.]

616
00:57:34.635 --> 00:57:38.130
That’s a little subtler. I think you’d better get your realization first

617
00:57:38.330 --> 00:57:42.869
and then you’ll know what it is. You see, also to read the Bible,

618
00:57:43.069 --> 00:57:46.807
not the Paul part because it’s only organizational.

619
00:57:47.007 --> 00:57:50.413
You must get your self-realization. Even to read Gita,

620
00:57:50.613 --> 00:57:57.198
you must get your self-realization, otherwise you can become confused.

621
00:58:03.768 --> 00:58:07.529
[Maybe we can have the questioning part later on at the end of the program?

622
00:58:07.729 --> 00:58:11.822
But should we, if people have other questions then I suggest

623
00:58:12.022 --> 00:58:16.891
that we can come down and [UNCLEAR].

624
00:58:17.091 --> 00:58:24.922
Shri Mataji this is what I would suggest if You be prepared, Shri Mataji,

625
00:58:25.122 --> 00:58:28.915
should we have the experience of collective meditation?

626
00:58:29.115 --> 00:58:33.559
Would you like it, would you like to have the experience?]

627
00:58:33.943 --> 00:58:39.399
Alright. As I told you, it cannot be forced.

628
00:58:39.599 --> 00:58:48.756
A very simple thing is. It's a thing is that you have to ask for it.

629
00:58:48.956 --> 00:58:56.505
It cannot be forced and it is vital that we should get it.

630
00:58:56.705 --> 00:59:00.224
All of the vital things, we got spontaneously,

631
00:59:00.424 --> 00:59:03.645
without any trouble as human beings.

632
00:59:03.845 --> 00:59:08.525
But this is another stage.

633
00:59:09.360 --> 00:59:16.455
Say we have become human beings from amoeba or from, say, monkeys.

634
00:59:17.620 --> 00:59:23.224
But now what we are going to become, we are going to be empowered,

635
00:59:23.424 --> 00:59:34.577
that we can transform people, that we can nourish the nature.

636
00:59:34.777 --> 00:59:40.272
So because of this jump that we have to have in our awareness

637
00:59:40.472 --> 00:59:48.555
and in our strength, we have to understand what it is,

638
00:59:48.755 --> 00:59:51.938
because God has given us brains to understand.

639
00:59:52.138 --> 00:59:59.069
Everything is logical, absolutely logical.

640
00:59:59.270 --> 01:00:05.099
You can judge for yourself and see for yourself.

641
01:00:06.498 --> 01:00:11.898
That is the reason why somebody has to tell you, decode it and tell you everything.

642
01:00:12.099 --> 01:00:16.211
And then once you know it, you can also tell others.

643
01:00:16.411 --> 01:00:21.486
It cannot be done in the way we have got this human awareness.

644
01:00:21.686 --> 01:00:26.767
It’s a much higher awareness about which I am talking

645
01:00:26.967 --> 01:00:32.610
and for that, somebody has to tell you all the subtleties, all the decoding.

646
01:00:32.810 --> 01:00:39.836
But that doesn’t mean that it is something obligatory for you.

647
01:00:40.036 --> 01:00:42.098
I personally think it’s nothing for Me.

648
01:00:42.299 --> 01:00:44.687
because whatever I have, I have, it’s nothing great.

649
01:00:44.887 --> 01:00:48.192
I don’t think it’s something great to have something born with it.

650
01:00:48.393 --> 01:00:53.148
But it’s definitely great for you to achieve it

651
01:00:53.348 --> 01:00:57.000
and that’s the thing I respect,

652
01:00:57.200 --> 01:01:01.287
that you have achieved all these powers yourself.

653
01:01:01.488 --> 01:01:06.762
So there is no obligation at all, in no way.

654
01:01:08.652 --> 01:01:12.241
So at the very outset,

655
01:01:12.441 --> 01:01:16.141
I have to tell you there are two conditions we have to have.

656
01:01:16.341 --> 01:01:20.383
The first condition is that

657
01:01:20.583 --> 01:01:26.236
we have to forget the past and forgive ourselves,

658
01:01:26.436 --> 01:01:31.670
that not to feel guilty at all.

659
01:01:32.498 --> 01:01:38.157
I mean, it’s something like a myth that we start feeling guilty.

660
01:01:38.357 --> 01:01:40.891
As a result, we catch on this centre here.

661
01:01:41.091 --> 01:01:43.491
The left side of the Vishuddhi, as we call it.

662
01:01:43.692 --> 01:01:48.102
This centre when you catch, you can get spondylitis,

663
01:01:48.302 --> 01:01:54.857
you can get paralysis, you can get angina.

664
01:01:56.813 --> 01:01:59.108
So it is useless to feel guilty.

665
01:01:59.316 --> 01:02:02.124
After all, you are human beings, you are not gods.

666
01:02:02.324 --> 01:02:04.993
If you have done mistakes, what’s there to feel guilty?

667
01:02:05.193 --> 01:02:10.634
Let the Kundalini find out. Why should we judge ourselves?

668
01:02:10.834 --> 01:02:14.837
That means you forget your past, forget your guilt and mistakes

669
01:02:15.037 --> 01:02:19.649
and everything and you have to be pleasantly placed toward yourself

670
01:02:19.849 --> 01:02:23.777
because now you are going to enter into the kingdom of God.

671
01:02:23.977 --> 01:02:29.064
So you should be pleasantly placed toward yourself.

672
01:02:29.265 --> 01:02:32.715
You have to respect, I would say you have to love yourself

673
01:02:32.923 --> 01:02:36.575
and know that you are a human being and have self-confidence

674
01:02:36.775 --> 01:02:40.321
that you are going to enter into the kingdom of God.

675
01:02:40.532 --> 01:02:47.362
This is the first condition. The second one is that you have to forgive everyone.

676
01:02:47.562 --> 01:02:53.002
The other day somebody said that to forgive others is very difficult.

677
01:02:53.202 --> 01:02:57.604
Now whether you forgive or don’t forgive, you don’t do anything.

678
01:02:57.804 --> 01:03:01.417
Again, logically, you don’t do anything. It’s just your idea that

679
01:03:01.617 --> 01:03:04.144
you don’t forgive,

680
01:03:04.344 --> 01:03:07.355
and if you don’t forgive, you play into the hands

681
01:03:07.555 --> 01:03:12.630
which are trying to harm you.

682
01:03:12.830 --> 01:03:21.817
The people who are, the ones who tortured you are very happy

683
01:03:22.017 --> 01:03:28.579
while you are the one who is suffering because you cannot forgive.

684
01:03:30.446 --> 01:03:37.941
So you have to forgive everyone. This is a very, very important, crucial point.

685
01:03:38.141 --> 01:03:44.285
As I told you, in this cross here of the optic chiasma resides Christ

686
01:03:44.485 --> 01:03:50.117
and what He has told us, He has given us the greatest weapon is to forgive.

687
01:03:50.318 --> 01:03:54.036
And if you don’t forgive, you cannot awaken Him,

688
01:03:54.236 --> 01:03:58.028
and if you cannot awaken Him, there are two functions:

689
01:03:58.228 --> 01:04:02.770
one is the Kundalini has to pass through and He sucks in

690
01:04:02.970 --> 01:04:07.340
our karmas and our conditionings from, you can see the two balloons there,

691
01:04:07.540 --> 01:04:14.269
to open up the limbic area for us, for the Kundalini to pass through.

692
01:04:14.469 --> 01:04:18.254
So if you do not forgive, it’s going to be difficult for Me,

693
01:04:18.454 --> 01:04:22.905
because I cannot forgive for you.

694
01:04:23.105 --> 01:04:28.847
So please, these two conditions, you have to fulfil.

695
01:04:32.521 --> 01:04:34.521
I hope it’s not too much.

696
01:04:34.739 --> 01:04:38.260
Now, we have to take the help of the Mother Earth,

697
01:04:38.460 --> 01:04:41.314
so if you could take out the shoes, it would be much better,

698
01:04:41.514 --> 01:04:46.084
just the shoes not the socks, but just the shoes.

699
01:04:58.700 --> 01:05:01.680
Please, come in, there's lots of space here

700
01:05:01.881 --> 01:05:05.255
Yes, just come.

701
01:05:12.678 --> 01:05:14.744
Modern Yoga is very wonderful, I think.

702
01:05:14.944 --> 01:05:18.931
Sitting on the chair, you can get your realization.

703
01:05:19.131 --> 01:05:24.108
You don’t have to do all kinds of asanas.

704
01:05:26.445 --> 01:05:31.476
It has to be that way.

705
01:05:34.163 --> 01:05:37.867
Now, pPlease remember, as I told you,

706
01:05:38.067 --> 01:05:40.699
this left side and right side there are two powers.

707
01:05:40.899 --> 01:05:45.207
The left side power is the power of desire. Not of pure desire, but desire.

708
01:05:45.407 --> 01:05:48.151
The right side is the power of action.

709
01:05:48.352 --> 01:05:51.714
We have to keep both our feet a little away from each other.

710
01:05:51.914 --> 01:05:54.699
We have to sit comfortably,

711
01:05:54.899 --> 01:05:59.247
not bending too much or putting yourself backwards too much,

712
01:05:59.447 --> 01:06:04.263
but just in a straight manner.

713
01:06:04.463 --> 01:06:11.246
And put your left hand towards me like this.

714
01:06:11.446 --> 01:06:14.957
This means that you want your self-realization,

715
01:06:15.157 --> 01:06:19.347
that you desire your self-realization.

716
01:06:19.547 --> 01:06:21.602
Just like this, very comfortable,

717
01:06:21.803 --> 01:06:25.048
please put your left hand towards me like this,

718
01:06:25.249 --> 01:06:28.538
and with the right hand, we’ll be nourishing our centres.

719
01:06:28.738 --> 01:06:32.584
So right hand, you have to put on your heart.

720
01:06:32.784 --> 01:06:36.420
We work on your the left-hand side.

721
01:06:36.620 --> 01:06:39.295
I’ll first show you and then we’ll close our eyes

722
01:06:39.495 --> 01:06:46.107
and we’ll work out the awakening of the Kundalini.

723
01:06:46.307 --> 01:06:49.552
In the heart resides the Spirit.

724
01:06:49.752 --> 01:06:54.793
So first we put the hand on the Spirit.

725
01:06:54.993 --> 01:07:01.191
Then we put our hand on the upper portion of the abdomen on the left-hand side.

726
01:07:01.391 --> 01:07:05.402
This is the centre of your mastery.

727
01:07:05.602 --> 01:07:11.951
That means by awakening this centre, you get that power

728
01:07:12.151 --> 01:07:17.236
by which you can master the art of Kundalini awakening.

729
01:07:18.261 --> 01:07:24.171
Then you take down your hand to the low portion of the abdomen and press it hard.

730
01:07:24.371 --> 01:07:29.366
This is the centre of pure knowledge.

731
01:07:29.566 --> 01:07:31.983
The pure knowledge is that knowledge that you get

732
01:07:32.183 --> 01:07:37.466
out of your evolutionary process which manifests on

733
01:07:37.667 --> 01:07:43.153
your nervous system, on you central nervous system.

734
01:07:44.894 --> 01:07:51.308
Then again you have to raise your hand in the upper portion of your abdomen.

735
01:07:56.498 --> 01:08:01.688
And then on your heart again.

736
01:08:07.394 --> 01:08:13.693
Then raise your right hand in the corner of your neck here,

737
01:08:13.893 --> 01:08:18.802
neck and your shoulder and turn your head to your right.

738
01:08:19.002 --> 01:08:22.507
This is the centre, which I told you just now,

739
01:08:22.707 --> 01:08:26.124
is completely disturbed when you feel guilty.

740
01:08:26.324 --> 01:08:31.437
I think today with all of you it has this problem,

741
01:08:31.637 --> 01:08:36.960
so again I say please, please forgive yourself.

742
01:08:37.160 --> 01:08:42.139
Then you have to take your right hand onto your forehead across like this

743
01:08:42.339 --> 01:08:45.881
and press it on both the sides.

744
01:08:46.081 --> 01:08:48.764
Put down your head and press it nicely.

745
01:08:48.964 --> 01:08:55.075
This is the centre for forgiving others.

746
01:08:56.817 --> 01:09:01.304
Take back your right hand on the back side of your head

747
01:09:01.504 --> 01:09:07.235
and push back your head on it. Let it rest.

748
01:09:07.435 --> 01:09:11.681
Here for your own satisfaction, without counting your mistakes,

749
01:09:11.881 --> 01:09:17.649
without feeling guilty, you have to ask forgiveness from the Divine Power

750
01:09:17.849 --> 01:09:20.367
which is All Pervading.

751
01:09:20.567 --> 01:09:24.325
Now you have to stretch your hand fully

752
01:09:24.526 --> 01:09:27.594
and put the centre of your palm

753
01:09:27.795 --> 01:09:35.902
on top of the fontanelle bone area which was a soft bone in your childhood.

754
01:09:36.102 --> 01:09:40.093
Please put it there exactly. Put down your head nicely,

755
01:09:40.294 --> 01:09:44.745
put down your head. Now, push back your fingers as much as you can,

756
01:09:44.945 --> 01:09:47.730
put down your head and push back your fingers.

757
01:09:47.930 --> 01:09:53.431
Now push your hand on the scalp nicely, so it gives some pressure

758
01:09:53.631 --> 01:09:58.371
and now you have to move your scalp very slowly clockwise

759
01:09:58.572 --> 01:10:02.323
seven times.

760
01:10:14.426 --> 01:10:18.735
Now this is all we have to do.

761
01:10:18.935 --> 01:10:21.684
You can take out your spectacles also. It might help your eyesight,

762
01:10:21.884 --> 01:10:24.852
so please take out your spectacles.

763
01:10:25.052 --> 01:10:30.844
Now again I repeat, you have to be pleasantly placed toward yourself.

764
01:10:31.044 --> 01:10:34.647
Don’t feel guilty.

765
01:10:34.847 --> 01:10:40.386
You have done nothing wrong in the eyes of the Divine.

766
01:10:43.448 --> 01:10:48.326
Please now put your left hand towards me and right hand on your heart,

767
01:10:48.526 --> 01:10:55.518
both the feet apart and now close your eyes.

768
01:11:03.027 --> 01:11:09.827
Here you have to ask a very fundamental question to me.

769
01:11:10.027 --> 01:11:14.084
You may call me Shri Mataji or Mother, whatever you like.

770
01:11:14.284 --> 01:11:18.052
“Mother, am I the Spirit?" Ask this question three times,

771
01:11:18.252 --> 01:11:24.896
“Mother, am I the Spirit?" Please ask this question three times in your heart.

772
01:11:35.304 --> 01:11:42.368
Now if you are the Spirit, you are your master, you are your guide.

773
01:11:42.568 --> 01:11:46.442
So take down your right hand the upper portion of the abdomen

774
01:11:46.643 --> 01:11:49.758
on the left-hand side, press it hard

775
01:11:49.958 --> 01:11:57.328
and here ask me another very fundamental question in your heart,

776
01:11:57.528 --> 01:12:01.999
“Mother, am I my own master? Mother, am I my own guru?”

777
01:12:02.199 --> 01:12:06.965
Ask this question three times.

778
01:12:30.661 --> 01:12:38.538
As I’ve told you that I respect your freedom and I cannot force

779
01:12:38.738 --> 01:12:42.827
pure knowledge on you. You have to ask for it.

780
01:12:43.027 --> 01:12:47.032
Now take down your right hand the lower portion of your abdomen,

781
01:12:47.232 --> 01:12:52.447
press it hard on the left-hand side and here you please say six times

782
01:12:52.647 --> 01:12:55.986
because this centre has got six petals.

783
01:12:56.186 --> 01:13:04.190
“Mother, please give me pure knowledge.”

784
01:13:04.391 --> 01:13:08.839
This knowledge has to manifest on your central nervous system

785
01:13:09.039 --> 01:13:13.266
giving you a new dimension.

786
01:13:18.460 --> 01:13:23.046
Ask earnestly.

787
01:13:24.507 --> 01:13:30.369
As soon as you ask this question, the Kundalini starts rising.

788
01:13:30.569 --> 01:13:33.583
So now we have to nourish the upper centers

789
01:13:33.783 --> 01:13:39.226
to open the passage for Kundalini rises.

790
01:13:40.206 --> 01:13:47.263
So now you raise your right hand on the upper portion of your abdomen

791
01:13:47.463 --> 01:13:50.878
and pressed it hard on the left hand side.

792
01:13:51.078 --> 01:13:56.455
Here now with full confidence, full confidance in youself,

793
01:13:56.656 --> 01:14:02.034
please say, "Mother, I am my own master", please say it,

794
01:14:02.235 --> 01:14:06.418
ten times, because this center has got ten petals.

795
01:14:06.618 --> 01:14:13.734
Please say it with full confidence, "Mother, I am my own master".

796
01:14:33.762 --> 01:14:38.750
As I have told you the very beginning that

797
01:14:38.950 --> 01:14:46.081
the Truth is you are not this body and you are not this intellect,

798
01:14:46.281 --> 01:14:54.403
you are not these emotions and you are not these conditionings or this ego.

799
01:14:54.603 --> 01:14:57.842
You are the pure Spirit.

800
01:14:58.042 --> 01:15:01.717
So now please raise your right hand on your heart

801
01:15:01.917 --> 01:15:07.890
and say it again will full confidence twelve times,

802
01:15:08.090 --> 01:15:13.672
“Mother, I am the Spirit. Mother, I am the Spirit.”

803
01:15:13.872 --> 01:15:19.405
Please say it twelve times.

804
01:15:44.071 --> 01:15:47.800
The Divine Power which is All-pervading

805
01:15:48.000 --> 01:15:56.616
is the Ocean of Knowledge and of Love.

806
01:15:57.811 --> 01:16:05.599
It is the ocean of Benevolence and Blessings.

807
01:16:05.800 --> 01:16:11.221
But above all, it is the Ocean of Forgiveness.

808
01:16:11.421 --> 01:16:16.371
So whatever mistakes you might have committed,

809
01:16:16.571 --> 01:16:22.504
this Ocean of Forgiveness has the power to dissolve everything.

810
01:16:22.704 --> 01:16:27.793
So please forgive yourself, forgive yourself,

811
01:16:27.993 --> 01:16:31.965
be pleasantly placed toward yourself

812
01:16:32.165 --> 01:16:37.729
and put your right in the corner of your neck and shoulder

813
01:16:37.929 --> 01:16:42.799
and turn your head to your right.

814
01:16:42.999 --> 01:16:45.918
Here you have to say with full confidence,

815
01:16:46.118 --> 01:16:51.035
“Mother, I am not guilty at all.” Please say it sixteen times

816
01:16:51.235 --> 01:16:54.013
because this centre has got sixteen petals.

817
01:16:54.213 --> 01:16:59.036
“Mother, I am not guilty at all.”

818
01:17:10.219 --> 01:17:17.284
I’ve already told you that whether you forgive or don’t forgive,

819
01:17:17.484 --> 01:17:21.989
you don’t do anything. But if you don’t forgive,

820
01:17:22.189 --> 01:17:27.926
then you play into wrong hands and suffer.

821
01:17:28.126 --> 01:17:32.871
So now raise your right hand on top of your forehead

822
01:17:33.071 --> 01:17:36.738
and put down your head on your hand properly.

823
01:17:36.938 --> 01:17:42.878
Press it on both the sides nicely and say it from your heart,

824
01:17:43.078 --> 01:17:49.300
“Mother, I forgive everyone.” I’m saying say it from your heart,

825
01:17:49.500 --> 01:17:54.799
not how many times, but say it from your heart.

826
01:17:54.999 --> 01:18:00.530
“Mother, I forgive everyone.”

827
01:18:10.951 --> 01:18:14.110
Now take back your hand on the back side of your head

828
01:18:14.310 --> 01:18:19.479
and push back your head on that hand nicely, let it rest.

829
01:18:19.679 --> 01:18:27.832
Here, please again remember, do not count your mistakes,

830
01:18:28.032 --> 01:18:36.699
do not feel guilty at all, but just for your satisfaction,

831
01:18:36.899 --> 01:18:42.151
you push back your head nicely, and say “Oh Divine Power,

832
01:18:42.351 --> 01:18:46.112
if I have done any mistakes knowingly or unknowingly,

833
01:18:46.312 --> 01:18:51.499
please forgive me.”

834
01:19:06.318 --> 01:19:11.384
Now, please stretch your hand, your palm fully.

835
01:19:11.584 --> 01:19:17.531
Put the centre of your palm on top of the fontanel bone area

836
01:19:17.732 --> 01:19:22.069
which was the soft bone in your childhood.

837
01:19:22.748 --> 01:19:27.025
Push back your fingers and press your scalp nicely.

838
01:19:27.225 --> 01:19:31.040
Here, again, I cannot cross over your freedom.

839
01:19:31.240 --> 01:19:33.978
You have to ask for your self-realization.

840
01:19:34.178 --> 01:19:37.845
So now please put down your head, press it hard

841
01:19:38.045 --> 01:19:44.875
and move your scalp seven times very slowly with pressure.

842
01:19:45.075 --> 01:19:48.336
Pushing back your fingers and here you have to say,

843
01:19:48.536 --> 01:19:54.062
“Mother, please give me my self-realization.”

844
01:19:54.262 --> 01:20:00.093
Put down your head nicely. “Mother, please give me my self-realization.”

845
01:20:00.293 --> 01:20:05.480
Seven times.

846
01:20:43.229 --> 01:20:48.190
Please take down your hand and open your eyes.

847
01:20:48.390 --> 01:20:54.884
Now, put both your hands towards me. Now try to think…

848
01:20:56.228 --> 01:21:00.016
Now watch me without thought. You can do it.

849
01:21:00.314 --> 01:21:03.331
You can watch me without thought. This is the first state

850
01:21:03.532 --> 01:21:08.006
you achieve called as thoughtless awareness.

851
01:21:08.990 --> 01:21:15.163
Now, put your right hand like this and right hand like this

852
01:21:15.364 --> 01:21:18.935
and left hand on top of your head, and put down your head

853
01:21:19.135 --> 01:21:23.943
and put your right hand and see for yourself, not on your head,

854
01:21:24.143 --> 01:21:26.911
but above your head, and see for yourself

855
01:21:27.111 --> 01:21:31.009
if there is a cool breeze coming out of your head.

856
01:21:31.210 --> 01:21:37.322
Put down you head, please put your right hand like this.

857
01:21:44.719 --> 01:21:48.988
Now please put your left hand towards me and put down your head

858
01:21:49.188 --> 01:21:58.250
and see for yourself if there is a cool breeze coming out of your head.

859
01:21:58.450 --> 01:22:02.438
With the right hand, you can feel it. Now, don’t put it on top.

860
01:22:02.638 --> 01:22:04.961
You have to put it above it, a little away.

861
01:22:05.161 --> 01:22:09.596
Some people might get hot heat coming out, that’s all right,

862
01:22:09.797 --> 01:22:11.988
and some people might get it far away.

863
01:22:12.188 --> 01:22:14.730
Doesn’t matter if there’s a heat coming out, it’s all right.

864
01:22:14.930 --> 01:22:19.542
The heat has to come out.

865
01:22:27.340 --> 01:22:30.625
Now, please put again the right hand. Bend your head again

866
01:22:30.825 --> 01:22:38.378
and see for yourself if there is a cool breeze coming out of your head.

867
01:22:42.565 --> 01:22:48.582
Now , please raises both of your hands, like this.

868
01:22:48.788 --> 01:22:53.621
Push back your head and ask a question three times, anyone of these,

869
01:22:53.830 --> 01:22:57.211
“Mother, is this the Cool Breeze of the Holy Ghost?.”

870
01:22:57.411 --> 01:23:05.454
“Mother, is this the Power of Love of God?”

871
01:23:05.654 --> 01:23:09.423
“Mother is this the All-Pervading Paramchaitanya.”

872
01:23:09.623 --> 01:23:15.544
Ask any one of these questions three times.

873
01:23:16.660 --> 01:23:19.890
Now don’t doubt. Because there is air conditioning, you may doubt,

874
01:23:20.091 --> 01:23:24.608
but there is nothing to doubt about it.

875
01:23:25.475 --> 01:23:27.697
Good.

876
01:23:27.897 --> 01:23:32.600
Now take down your hands.

877
01:23:33.608 --> 01:23:37.658
All those who’ve felt the cool breeze or the heat

878
01:23:37.858 --> 01:23:45.006
or the cool in their hands, out of their heads or on the hands,

879
01:23:45.206 --> 01:23:49.029
please raise both your hands. All those who have felt

880
01:23:49.229 --> 01:23:53.881
cool breeze out of your head or in your hands.

881
01:23:54.081 --> 01:23:56.904
Is very good.

882
01:23:57.105 --> 01:24:01.845
May God bless United Nations

883
01:24:02.045 --> 01:24:05.763
Most of you have felt it. Some have not, doesn’t matter.

884
01:24:05.964 --> 01:24:09.068
It doesn’t mean there is something wrong with you.

885
01:24:09.272 --> 01:24:16.394
But we have a club here, thank God, this is being (...)

886
01:24:16.594 --> 01:24:20.255
and you are all welcome. And we have great experts of Sahaja Yoga

887
01:24:20.455 --> 01:24:23.330
in New York, that’s one thing I must say,

888
01:24:23.531 --> 01:24:26.091
we have great experts of Sahaja Yoga

889
01:24:26.291 --> 01:24:29.514
and they will tell you each and everything about it, the whole knowledge.

890
01:24:29.714 --> 01:24:33.412
You don’t have to pay for it. Only little bit of time, you have to give.

891
01:24:33.612 --> 01:24:35.929
These days we have watches to save time,

892
01:24:36.129 --> 01:24:39.101
but we save time to waste it.

893
01:24:39.301 --> 01:24:42.960
We have to save time to use it for our ascent

894
01:24:43.160 --> 01:24:45.760
and you don’t need much time for this.

895
01:24:46.021 --> 01:24:48.634
About five minutes in the morning and ten minutes in the evening

896
01:24:48.834 --> 01:24:51.493
is more than sufficient, but you must first learn

897
01:24:51.693 --> 01:24:55.579
and you all must become great masters of Sahaja Yoga.

898
01:24:55.779 --> 01:24:59.657
Next time when I come I hope I’ll be able to see

899
01:24:59.857 --> 01:25:03.742
lots of people who have got realization through you.

900
01:25:03.942 --> 01:25:08.676
May God bless you all.

901
01:25:17.298 --> 01:25:22.542
[May I ask one additional question regarding this self-realization?

902
01:25:22.742 --> 01:25:26.261
When people ask what do I do as a Sahaja Yogi,

903
01:25:26.461 --> 01:25:32.888
I had it explained what do we do,

904
01:25:33.088 --> 01:25:38.861
but they ask me what is this based on to make it work?]

905
01:25:43.134 --> 01:25:48.543
You see, it is actually is a state, is a state of our being.

906
01:25:48.743 --> 01:25:51.786
An ones first state is of thoughtless awareness.

907
01:25:51.986 --> 01:25:55.676
The second one is doubtless awareness. So you have to rise up to that

908
01:25:55.876 --> 01:25:58.497
and then you know everything yourself, I mean,

909
01:25:58.697 --> 01:26:02.335
it’s not much to explain because it becomes part and parcel of…

910
01:26:02.535 --> 01:26:05.816
Like I can see clearly this carpet, in the same way,

911
01:26:06.017 --> 01:26:09.718
I can clearly feel when I am a realized soul about everything.

912
01:26:09.918 --> 01:26:15.355
So we have to rise up to that level, but not blindly.

